# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What's next? {#whats-next}"
msgstr "Ano ang susunod? {#whats-next}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now that you’ve learned the fundamentals of quantum-safe cryptography, "
"explore the technologies IBM Quantum&reg; offers for modernizing your "
"cryptographic landscape and building quantum cyber resilience. [IBM Quantum "
"Safe&trade;](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe) is a comprehensive "
"set of tools, capabilities, and approaches combined with deep expertise to "
"help you plan and execute your organization’s migration to quantum-safe "
"cryptography. Discover, observe, and transform your cryptography with three "
"core technical capabilities:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ngayong natutunan mo na ang mga pangunahing kaalaman ng quantum-safe "
"cryptography, tuklasin ang mga teknolohiyang inaalok ng IBM Quantum&reg; "
"para i-modernize ang iyong cryptographic landscape at buuin ang quantum "
"cyber resilience. Ang [IBM Quantum "
"Safe&trade;](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe) ay isang "
"komprehensibong hanay ng mga tool, kakayahan, at diskarte na sinasamahan ng "
"malalim na kaalaman para tulungan kang planuhin at isagawa ang paglipat ng "
"iyong organisasyon sa quantum-safe cryptography. Tuklasin, obserbahan, at "
"baguhin ang iyong cryptography gamit ang tatlong pangunahing teknikal na "
"kakayahan:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**1. IBM Quantum Safe Explorer**\n"
msgstr "**1. IBM Quantum Safe Explorer**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Explorer simplifies the discovery and management of "
"cryptography by performing source code and object code scanning to identify "
"all cryptographically relevant artifacts, uncover dependencies, and surface "
"vulnerabilities. Explorer represents this data in a [Cryptography Bill of "
"Materials](https://github.com/IBM/CBOM) (CBOM), a common extension to the "
"Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) that systematizes the creation and sharing"
" of metadata describing cryptographic artifacts.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pinasimple ng IBM Quantum Safe Explorer ang pagtuklas at pamamahala ng "
"cryptography sa pamamagitan ng pag-scan ng source code at object code para "
"matukoy ang lahat ng cryptographically relevant na artifact, matuklasan ang "
"mga dependency, at maipakita ang mga kahinaan. Kinakatawan ng Explorer ang "
"data na ito sa isang [Cryptography Bill of "
"Materials](https://github.com/IBM/CBOM) (CBOM), isang karaniwang extension "
"ng Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) na nagpapatakbo ng paglikha at "
"pagbabahagi ng metadata na naglalarawan ng mga cryptographic artifact.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**2. IBM Quantum Safe Advisor**\n"
msgstr "**2. IBM Quantum Safe Advisor**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Advisor complements the static code analysis from IBM "
"Quantum Safe Explorer with a dynamic, runtime perspective of your "
"cryptographic posture and compliance. Advisor correlates [CBOMs][CBOM] and "
"aggregates data from network and endpoint scans to build a comprehensive "
"cryptographic inventory. This inventory details:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pinapalaki ng IBM Quantum Safe Advisor ang static code analysis mula sa IBM "
"Quantum Safe Explorer gamit ang dynamic, runtime na pananaw ng iyong "
"cryptographic posture at compliance. Iniuugnay ng Advisor ang mga "
"[CBOM][CBOM] at pinagsasama ang data mula sa mga network at endpoint scan "
"para makabuo ng komprehensibong cryptographic inventory. Inilalarawan ng "
"inventory na ito ang:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The types and locations of your cryptographic instances\n"
msgstr "Ang mga uri at lokasyon ng iyong mga cryptographic instance\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Associated certificates, cipher suites, and CBOMs\n"
msgstr "Mga kaugnay na sertipiko, cipher suite, at CBOM\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The relationships between assets and data flows\n"
msgstr "Ang mga relasyon sa pagitan ng mga asset at data flow\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Potential vulnerabilities to quantum technology\n"
msgstr "Mga potensyal na kahinaan sa quantum technology\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With its policy-based enrichment, Advisor equips you to evaluate your "
"cryptography and data compliance and generate a prioritized list of "
"vulnerabilities so that you can establish a quantum-safe remediation "
"strategy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa tulong ng policy-based enrichment nito, inihahanda ka ng Advisor na "
"suriin ang iyong cryptography at data compliance at makabuo ng prioritized "
"na listahan ng mga kahinaan para makapagtatag ka ng quantum-safe remediation"
" strategy.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**3. IBM Quantum Safe Remediator**\n"
msgstr "**3. IBM Quantum Safe Remediator**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Remediator enables you to apply best practices for quantum-"
"safe remediation patterns focused on VPN communication, TLS communication, "
"and cluster access communication. Build crypto-agility by exploring "
"solutions for transforming your cryptography without disrupting business "
"operations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Binibigyan ka ng IBM Quantum Safe Remediator ng kakayahang ilapat ang mga "
"pinakamahusay na gawi para sa mga quantum-safe remediation pattern na "
"nakatuon sa VPN communication, TLS communication, at cluster access "
"communication. Bumuo ng crypto-agility sa pamamagitan ng pag-explore ng mga "
"solusyon para baguhin ang iyong cryptography nang hindi nagagambala ang mga "
"operasyon ng negosyo.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the [technology guide](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/assets/quantum-"
"safe/IBM_Quantum-Safe-Technology-Brochure.pdf), and learn more on the [IBM "
"Quantum Safe site.](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe)\n"
msgstr ""
"Basahin ang [technology guide](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/assets/quantum-"
"safe/IBM_Quantum-Safe-Technology-Brochure.pdf), at matuto pa sa [IBM Quantum"
" Safe site.](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe)\n"

